# Parabank QA Automation Suite

## Overview
This is a full-stack, CI/CD-ready QA automation framework designed to validate the Parabank demo application across multiple layers:

- ✅ API Testing (RestAssured + TestNG)
- ✅ UI Testing (Selenium + Page Object Model)
- ✅ Database Validation (JDBC + SQL)
- ✅ BDD Testing (Cucumber + Gherkin)
- ✅ Performance Testing (JMeter)
- ✅ Microservices Testing (Docker + Kubernetes)
- ✅ Reporting (Allure, Extent, PDF)
- ✅ CI/CD Integration (Maven + Docker + Jenkins/GitHub Actions)

