## How to Run Tests

### Run all TestNG tests:
```bash: mvn clean test
Run Cucumber BDD tests:
```bash: mvn test -Dcucumber.options="--tags @Smoke"
Generate Allure Report:
```bash:
mvn allure:report
mvn allure:serve

Key Principles Demonstrated
•	Backend constraints: JSON and SQL tests show how unsupported formats return 403/404.
•	Modular architecture: Each layer is isolated and reusable.
•	Traceability: Reports, screenshots, and logs are stored per run.
•	CI/CD readiness: Fully Maven-compatible and Dockerized.

